    "intro_html":  "Pulled pork gets all the attention, but shredded beef holds barbecue sauce better and reheats without drying out, which makes it the smarter choice for a week of containers. The sauce is built from scratch out of ketchup, brown sugar, vinegar, and mustard, so you control the sweetness instead of a bottle deciding for you. Each bowl carries \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and {{cal}} calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
